# ============================================================
# Source material containing identifiable child health data
# ============================================================
# The register photographs contain real children's names, ages, parents' names,
# contact numbers and health findings. Committing them would embed identifiable
# child health information permanently in version-control history.
# They stay on disk for analysis but are deliberately NOT versioned.
# See docs/08_SECURITY_ARCHITECTURE.md.
reference_materials/

